// UTUWin.ZC - package-driven UWindow client (Engine Client shape).
//
// PubSrc: Window/=Win32 only; Engine Canvas natives. No UWindow.uc.
// Retail bytecode embeds class text + Texture exports in UMenu.u / UWindow.u.
// SoftDrv = URenderDevice. Paint = Canvas DrawTile/DrawText → P8.
//
// Host mirrors CreateRootWindow / UMenuRootWindow.Paint / LookAndFeel
// Menu_Draw* from System/*.u ScriptText. Art = UMenu.u Texture exports.
// Start Match → UTClientStartMatch. See docs/Apps/UT99/PORT.md.

